 a much-needed reform.* ### Amendment text The amendment text is available on [sheet 1382](https://parlinfo.aph.gov.au/parlInfo/search/display/display.w3p;query=Id:legislation/billhome/display.w3p;query=Id%3A%22legislation%2Famend%2Fs1306_amend_93793eac-266b-4b0f-bdb9-cb805cafc047%22;rec=0).","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7429","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2021-09-01/6"}
